---

<BaseLayout
  title="Conference | CTG Federal"
  description="The latest updates and announcements on where CTG Federal will be and what we are up to at the IT industry’s biggest conferences."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Conference" title="Conference" />

  <Section tone="white">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>NLIT 2026</h2>
      <p class="tag">May 4–May 7 | Kansas City Convention Center, Bartle Hall | Kansas City, MO</p>
      <span class="accent-bar"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="prose">
      The 2026 NLIT Summit is sponsored by the NLIT Society, a professional society founded to
      facilitate the exchange of best practices and ideas among IT and Cybersecurity
      professionals within the DOE complex, strengthen the infrastructure, and identify
      efficiencies within the DOE laboratory system. The Summit facilitates sharing
      information regarding all aspects of IT and Cybersecurity operations, technology,
      policies, and practices in support of research conducted at the Laboratories. It is open
      to all personnel in the IT and Cybersecurity fields working at Laboratories and Plants
      affiliated with government funded activities, as well as Federal government employees in
      the IT or Cybersecurity fields that work at agencies associated with the participating
      Laboratories.
    </p>

    <div class="conference-booking">
      <h3>Do you want one-on-one time with one of our rockstar team members?</h3>
      <p>Book a time to meet here at the Kansas City Marriott Downtown.</p>
      <p>
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href={bookingUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Big Joe Turner B, 3rd Floor</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="subtle">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>Agenda</h2>
      <span class="accent-bar"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="h4">Booth 401</p>
    <p><a href={floorPlanUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Floor Plan</a></p>

    <div class="agenda-day">
      <p class="agenda-day__date">Monday, May 4</p>
      <h4>Exhibit Hall Welcome Reception</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Location: Exhibit Hall</li>
        <li>Time: 5:00pm–7:00pm</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="tag">CTGF Event</p>
      <h4>Keys and Cocktails Post-Welcome Reception</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Location: Hotel No Vacancy</li>
        <li>Time: 7:00pm – 9:00pm</li>
        <li>For more details and to register, click <a href={welcomeReceptionUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="agenda-day">
      <p class="agenda-day__date">Tuesday, May 5</p>
      <p>NLIT Summit begins with a full day of sessions.</p>
      <h4>Josh Schultz presents – From Chatbots to Coworkers: Building Intelligence That Persists</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Time: 9:00AM – 9:30AM</li>
        <li>Room: 2210</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="agenda-day">
      <p class="agenda-day__date">Wednesday, May 6</p>
      <p>NLIT Summit continues with a full day of sessions.</p>
      <h4>Brad Baker presents – Sovereign AI Foundations: Secure Infrastructure for DOE Missions in a GenAI World</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Time: 10:40AM – 11:10AM</li>
        <li>Room: 2102B</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="tag">CTGF Event</p>
      <h4>Heartland Hoedown Closing Reception</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Location: PBR Big Sky</li>
        <li>Time: 7:00pm–10:00pm</li>
        <li>For more details and to register, click <a href={closingReceptionUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="agenda-day">
      <p class="agenda-day__date">Thursday, May 7</p>
      <p>NLIT Summit continues with a full morning of sessions to conclude by 1pm. Afternoon workshops to follow.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="white">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>CTG Members in Attendance</h2>
      <span class="accent-bar"></span>
    </div>
    <ul class="attendee-grid">
      {
        attendees.map((person) => (
          <li class="card">
            <h4>{person.name}</h4>
            <p>{person.role}</p>
            <p>T: <a href={`tel:${person.phone}`}>{person.phone}</a></p>
            <p>E: <a href={`mailto:${person.email}`}>{person.email}</a></p>
            {person.region && <p class="attendee-grid__region">{person.region}</p>}
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .conference-booking {
    margin-top: var(--sp-10);
    padding-top: var(--sp-10);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .agenda-day {
    margin-top: var(--sp-10);
    padding-top: var(--sp-8);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .agenda-day:first-of-type {
    margin-top: var(--sp-8);
  }
  .agenda-day__date {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-tag);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--azure);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-2);
  }
  .attendee-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--sp-5);
    list-style: none;
    margin: var(--sp-8) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .attendee-grid__region {
    font-size: var(--fs-12);
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .attendee-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .attendee-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
